# The build context is an allow-list: everything is excluded unless it is listed below.
# That keeps secrets, history and local files out of the image build by default.
**

# What the API and migration images need
!dotnet-tools.json
!src/**

# Even inside src/, never send build output, local settings or secrets
**/bin
**/obj
**/.vs
**/.idea
**/*.user
**/appsettings.Local.json
**/secrets.json
**/.env
**/.env.*

# The console client is not part of either image
src/VehicleRental.Console
